00051: {"id":"CORE-C0051","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[94,94],"text":"- 以「物种 id」结尾未配等级 → 报错。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00052: {"id":"CORE-C0052","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[95,95],"text":"- 数组形式与分隔参数形式的校验位置不同：单参数 [物种， 等级] 先查询物种，再把等级传给创建入口，仍生成新个体；该分支不执行分隔式的整数/1..最大等级前置检查。等级在后续个体创建的等级写入处处理（范围非法可报错；不保证与分隔式具有相同的类型检查或错误文本）。分隔式在「等待等级」阶段先做整数与范围校验。遇到数组时若仍有待配等级的物种也报悬挂配对错误；不把后续创建错误冒充统一入口错误。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00053: {"id":"CORE-C0053","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[96,96],"text":"- 空对手数组会由战斗初始化拒绝（§4.1）。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00054: {"id":"CORE-C0054","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[98,98],"text":"训练家输入逐项解析（任一形式）：","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00055: {"id":"CORE-C0055","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[100,100],"text":"- 训练家对象 → 直接加入（道具、队伍、队伍起始）。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00056: {"id":"CORE-C0056","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[101,101],"text":"- [类型， 名称， 版本号， 收场台词（可选）] → 从数据装载（失败先走「缺失训练家」兜底再重试装载；仍失败 → 报错「数据 '{…}' 的训练家未定义」）；装载成功 → 触发「训练家装载」；有台词则覆盖收场台词。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00057: {"id":"CORE-C0057","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[102,102],"text":"- 类型/名称/版本号分隔式：类型须存在；名称须为非空字符串；版本号须 ≥ 0 整数；名称后紧邻整数视为版本号，否则按无版本装载。悬挂（类型后无名称等）→ 报错「训练家类型 {X} 已给出但未给训练家名」。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00058: {"id":"CORE-C0058","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[103,103],"text":"- 空队伍同样由战斗初始化拒绝。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00059: {"id":"CORE-C0059","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[107,107],"text":"条件（两者任一）：玩家可战斗成员数 = 0；或调试模式且按住 Ctrl。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00060: {"id":"CORE-C0060","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[109,109],"text":"跳过路径的写入（按训练家战斗分叉仅有消息差异）：","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00061: {"id":"CORE-C0061","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[111,111],"text":"- 消息：非训练家战斗且队伍非空 →「SKIPPING BATTLE...」；训练家战斗在调试下同消息；训练家战斗且仍有可战斗成员 →「AFTER WINNING...」。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00062: {"id":"CORE-C0062","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[112,112],"text":"- 清空创建期规则字典；恢复被暂停的 BGM（备忘 BGM＋播放位置）；清除备忘 BGM/位置与四个「下一战」备忘（BGM/胜利曲/捕获 ME/背景）；重置遭遇步计数（WP36 交界）。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00063: {"id":"CORE-C0063","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[113,113],"text":"- 结果：常规 = 1（胜）；训练家战斗且可战斗成员为 0 → 0（未决）；写入基准备份变量并返回结果。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00064: {"id":"CORE-C0064","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[114,114],"text":"- 不触发开场动画、不创建战斗对象、不触发「开始战斗」。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00065: {"id":"CORE-C0065","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[118,118],"text":"- 可双打/三打查询：玩家可战斗数 ≥ 2/≥ 3 即可；或有伙伴时可战斗数 ≥ 1/≥ 2。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00066: {"id":"CORE-C0066","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[119,119],"text":"- 伙伴参与资格：无伙伴或 noPartner 规则 → 否；对手侧多于 1 个个体 → 是；否则仅在显式尺寸规则不是 single/1v 开头时为是；无尺寸规则 → 否。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00067: {"id":"CORE-C0067","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[120,120],"text":"- 参与时：读取伙伴类型、名称、身份与队伍（身份作为训练家版本的读取边界沿 WP24）；取得独立的伙伴可用道具列表，缺失则为空。按玩家段、伙伴段建立有序参与集合，保留成员共享身份，伙伴段从玩家段长度处开始；当前玩家队伍后来可与该集合分离，详 WP38/WP42。不规定训练家对象构造或数组组织；未显式设尺寸 → 自动加 double 规则。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00068: {"id":"CORE-C0068","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[121,121],"text":"- 队伍细分（所有者）在战斗内由队伍起始 + 业主索引映射（§5）。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00069: {"id":"CORE-C0069","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[129,129],"text":"- 拒绝：参与数组 1 为空 →「Party 1 has no Pokémon.」；参与数组 2 为空 →「Party 2 has no Pokémon.」（异常抛出，创建失败）。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00070: {"id":"CORE-C0070","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[130,130],"text":"- 初始值：侧尺寸 [1,1]；决定 0；回合计 0；可逃/可换 = 真、可败 = 假；开关动画 = 真；经验/金钱收益 = 真；禁用球 = 假；发送盒子默认 1；Mega 登记每训练家 −1；初始持有物记录双方创建时道具；参战标记全假；记录带环标志的物品身份，建立 AI 选择所需的战斗上下文。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00071: {"id":"CORE-C0071","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[131,131],"text":"- 阵营判定：对方训练家为空 → 野生战斗；否则训练家战斗。单个训练家按一名所有者处理；未提供身份仍保留野生边界，不要求包装为单元素数组。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00072: {"id":"CORE-C0072","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[132,132],"text":"- 队伍顺序数组初始为自然顺序；战斗内换人只重排顺序数组而不重排参与数组（WP41）。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00073: {"id":"CORE-C0073","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[136,136],"text":"尺寸字符串 → [玩家侧， 对方侧]：triple/3v3 → [3,3]；3v2 → [3,2]；3v1 → [3,1]；2v3 → [2,3]；double/2v2 → [2,2]；2v1 → [2,1]；1v3 → [1,3]；1v2 → [1,2]；其它/缺省 → [1,1]。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00074: {"id":"CORE-C0074","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[138,138],"text":"- 上限 = 每侧 3 席；不存在 4 席及以上的已支持布局（源注释明示需要改代码；见未决）。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00075: {"id":"CORE-C0075","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[139,139],"text":"- 单打判定 = 双侧各 1；单打/双打/三打日志与开场动画类型由尺寸推导。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00076: {"id":"CORE-C0076","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[140,140],"text":"- 位置编号：席位索引 i 的侧 = i % 2（0 玩家侧、1 对方侧）；同侧席位对为 i 与 i+2……；最大席位索引由较大侧尺寸推导。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00077: {"id":"CORE-C0077","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[141,141],"text":"- 对面取序（给定全局席位索引，返回对侧席位「最直接对面 → 次之」的完整序；用于目标光标与「最直接对面」）：","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00078: {"id":"CORE-C0078","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[143,143],"text":"| 布局（我方×对方） | 我方席位视角 | 对方席位视角 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00079: {"id":"CORE-C0079","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[145,145],"text":"| 1v1 | 0 → [1] | 1 → [0] |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00080: {"id":"CORE-C0080","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[146,146],"text":"| 1v2 | 0 → [3,1] | 1/3 → [0] |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00081: {"id":"CORE-C0081","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[147,147],"text":"| 1v3 | 0 → [3,5,1] | 1/3/5 → [0] |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00082: {"id":"CORE-C0082","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[148,148],"text":"| 2v1 | 0/2 → [1] | 1 → [0,2] |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00083: {"id":"CORE-C0083","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[149,149],"text":"| 2v2 | 0 → [3,1]；2 → [1,3] | 1 → [2,0]；3 → [0,2] |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00084: {"id":"CORE-C0084","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[150,150],"text":"| 2v3 | 0 → [5,3,1]；2 → [3,1,5] | 1 → [2,0]；3/5 → [0,2] |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00085: {"id":"CORE-C0085","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[151,151],"text":"| 3v1 | 0/2/4 → [1] | 1 → [2,0,4] |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00086: {"id":"CORE-C0086","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[152,152],"text":"| 3v2 | 0 → [3,1]；2 → [3,1]；4 → [1,3] | 1 → [2,4,0]；3 → [2,0,4] |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00087: {"id":"CORE-C0087","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[153,153],"text":"| 3v3 | 0 → [5,3,1]；2 → [3,5,1]；4 → [1,3,5] | 1 → [4,2,0]；3 → [2,0,4]；5 → [0,2,4] |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00088: {"id":"CORE-C0088","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[155,155],"text":"（3v2 全局席位 1 → [2,4,0] 为具名核对点；全部九种布局均已列出，不再以示例代替全表。）","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00089: {"id":"CORE-C0089","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[157,157],"text":"- 邻近关系（用于邻近限定效果，WP44/45 引用）：双侧均 ≤ 2 → 除自身外任意两席位均邻近；更大布局按「不相邻对」表判定——基础对 {0,4}、{1,5}（覆盖 3v1/1v3）；3v3 追加 {0,1}、{4,5}；3v2 追加 {0,1}、{3,4}；2v3 追加 {0,1}、{2,5}。两名席位命中任一不相邻对 → 非邻近；否则邻近（同一席位除外）。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00090: {"id":"CORE-C0090","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[161,161],"text":"1. 硬性拒绝：训练家战斗且任一侧尺寸 > 2，同时双方都多于 1 名训练家 → 报错「Can't have battles larger than 2v2 where both sides have multiple trainers」（理由：多训练家时远位参战者无法互相接近）。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00091: {"id":"CORE-C0091","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[162,162],"text":"2. 野生侧自动同步：参与者校验按队统计可战斗野生计数；若它与野生侧尺寸不一致，双侧原相等则双侧同改为该计数，否则只改野生侧。此处区别于 §3.1 核心起初按输入对手个数设置默认尺寸的时点。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00092: {"id":"CORE-C0092","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[163,163],"text":"3. 每训练家必需席位与首个失败：先比较需占位的业主范围与实际建立的可战斗计数范围，再逐业主比较席位需求。计数只在遇到可战斗成员时建立；缺失计数不自动规范化为 0。已有 NPC 对象的非空全濒死队伍可通过构造的非空门，但默认 1v1 中需求范围为 1、计数范围为空，先报 invalid-owner 错误，不到“has no able Pokémon”分支。若某个较早队伍段没有可战斗成员、较后段有，范围中间可为空值；范围长度门通过后，对空计数的数量比较可先失败，不能统一宣称消息分支可达。实际存在的计数项若无席位则有该侧具名错误；可比较的计数不足而必需席位为 1 时，才到“has no able Pokémon”分支。普通生成数据、已有对象与人为不完整段分别看待；不声称默认 PBS 一定提供异常队伍。训练家核心此前已触发开战记录并清创建期规则，失败不承诺回滚。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00093: {"id":"CORE-C0093","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[164,164],"text":"4. 缩减循环：某训练家可战斗数不足以填其必需席位 → 训练家战斗将两侧中较大者 −1（相等时两侧一起 −1）后重试；野生战斗只改玩家侧（野生侧固定）。缩到 0 → 报错「Couldn't lower either side's size any further, battle isn't possible」。具名场景：① 两侧各一名训练家、原 2v2、玩家仅 1 只可战斗而对方至少 2 只 → 降到 1v1；② 两只可战斗野生、玩家仅 1 只且无伙伴（原 2v2）→ 1v2（野生侧固定、仅玩家侧降）。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00094: {"id":"CORE-C0094","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[165,165],"text":"5. 该算法只删减席位、不新增；不会把不足成员补位成额外个体。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00095: {"id":"CORE-C0095","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[169,169],"text":"- 开场消息与派出顺序：对方先、玩家后；对方多名训练家/伙伴按序拼接消息；玩家消息最后。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00096: {"id":"CORE-C0096","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[170,170],"text":"- 野生开场按对手个数 1/2/3 具名消息；训练家按对方人数具名「挑战」消息。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00097: {"id":"CORE-C0097","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[171,171],"text":"- 派出对每个席位调用入场形态钩子（§7.2）；野生席位在建立时另外以「wild = true」调用一次入场钩子并登记已见（图鉴「见过」，WP62 前向）。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00098: {"id":"CORE-C0098","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[172,172],"text":"- 开场后按顺序播放：天气播报（当前战斗天气，WP45 前向）→ 场地播报 → 全员入场特性检查（WP49 前向）→ 进入主循环（命令 → 攻击 → 回合末，WP40/41/42）。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00099: {"id":"CORE-C0099","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[176,176],"text":"显示秩初始自然，与完成初始派出后的结果分开；实际参与成员和显示秩也不保证始终是同一长度的全排列。普通训练家核心显式 triple、noPartner，玩家单业主3名可战，对方业主 A/B 各2名可战，合并顺序 A0/A1/B0/B1、段起点0/2：没有命中“双侧都多业主”的拒绝门，需求玩家3、对方A2/B1均满足。A的队伍下标0/1绑定敌席1/3，B的下标2绑定敌席5。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
00100: {"id":"CORE-C0100","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[178,178],"text":"在 B 首次初始派出已绑定之后，开场重排把该成员的秩与“B段起点＋全侧已派出数”的位置交换；此前全侧已派出2名，目的位置4越过原4项记录。审计向量[0,1,2,3]→[0,1,空,3,2]，队伍下标2的显示秩缺项而参与成员仍只有4名。这是合法输入的开场生产边界，不要求未来采用五项数组或复制交换实现，也不等于 GR-013 参战布尔记录错位。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F007","CORE-F015","CORE-F016","CORE-F017"]}
